			"updated": 1795545616549,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "askAgentFn({ data }) is called by send(question,\nearlier)\n• conversationId.current ??= crypto.randomUUID()\n  one per thread, cleared by \"New chat\"\n• history = earlier answered exchanges → flatMap to\n  two turns each → .slice(-6)\n\ndata = {\n  question: string,            // trimmed, <= 500 \n  chars\n  history: [                   // <= 12 turns (6 sent)\n    { role: 'user' | 'model', text: string }\n  ],\n  conversation_id: string      // lowercase UUID\n}",
			"originalText": "askAgentFn({ data }) is called by send(question,\nearlier)\n• conversationId.current ??= crypto.randomUUID()\n  one per thread, cleared by \"New chat\"\n• history = earlier answered exchanges → flatMap to\n  two turns each → .slice(-6)\n\ndata = {\n  question: string,            // trimmed, <= 500 \n  chars\n  history: [                   // <= 12 turns (6 sent)\n    { role: 'user' | 'model', text: string }\n  ],\n  conversation_id: string      // lowercase UUID\n}",
