			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "fetch(`${AGENT_URL}/ask`, { method: 'POST', signal:\nAbortSignal.timeout(120_000) })\n\nbody (JSON) = { question, history, conversation_id }\n\nErrors become safe messages:\n• timeout → 'The agent took too long to answer'\n• no connection → \"The agent service isn't running\"\n• 400 → the agent's own message\n• anything else → 'The agent failed to answer'",
			"originalText": "fetch(`${AGENT_URL}/ask`, { method: 'POST', signal:\nAbortSignal.timeout(120_000) })\n\nbody (JSON) = { question, history, conversation_id }\n\nErrors become safe messages:\n• timeout → 'The agent took too long to answer'\n• no connection → \"The agent service isn't running\"\n• 400 → the agent's own message\n• anything else → 'The agent failed to answer'",
