			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Handler.do_POST('/ask')  → handle_ask(payload,\nask_fn)\n• validate(payload) → (question.strip(), turns[{role,\n  text}], conversation_id)\n  400 if question empty / > 500, history > 12, bad \n  role, or conversation_id not a lowercase UUID\n• ask_fn(question, history=history)  ( =\n  nl_to_sql.ask )\n• any exception → log it, reply 500 { error: 'The\n  agent failed' }   (no SQL or traceback leaks)\nService has no login, so it must stay off the public\ninternet.",
			"originalText": "Handler.do_POST('/ask')  → handle_ask(payload,\nask_fn)\n• validate(payload) → (question.strip(), turns[{role,\n  text}], conversation_id)\n  400 if question empty / > 500, history > 12, bad \n  role, or conversation_id not a lowercase UUID\n• ask_fn(question, history=history)  ( =\n  nl_to_sql.ask )\n• any exception → log it, reply 500 { error: 'The\n  agent failed' }   (no SQL or traceback leaks)\nService has no login, so it must stay off the public\ninternet.",
