			"baseFontSize": null
		},
		{
			"id": "t-50",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 56,
			"y": 732.8,
			"width": 876.5859375,
			"height": 218.4,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"g-47"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 2120395275,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 1271546377,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795545616549,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "response = genai_client.models.generate_content(model=answer.model, contents=contents, config=config)\n\nresponse.usage_metadata → ModelCall{ prompt_tokens, output_tokens, thinking_tokens, cached_tokens,\ntotal_tokens, latency_ms }  → answer.model_calls\nresponse.function_calls → list of FunctionCall (0 or more per turn)\n  FunctionCall = { name: 'sql' | 'roll_odds' | 'gold_projection',  args: { ...keyword args picked by the\n   model... } }\n\nGemini chooses the tool and fills args from the user's wording, the system prompt (INSTRUCTIONS) and\nthe earlier tool results.\n\nno function_calls and response.text  →  answer.text = response.text, return  (go to 7)\nfunction_calls present               →  6b",
			"originalText": "response = genai_client.models.generate_content(model=answer.model, contents=contents, config=config)\n\nresponse.usage_metadata → ModelCall{ prompt_tokens, output_tokens, thinking_tokens, cached_tokens,\ntotal_tokens, latency_ms }  → answer.model_calls\nresponse.function_calls → list of FunctionCall (0 or more per turn)\n  FunctionCall = { name: 'sql' | 'roll_odds' | 'gold_projection',  args: { ...keyword args picked by the\n   model... } }\n\nGemini chooses the tool and fills args from the user's wording, the system prompt (INSTRUCTIONS) and\nthe earlier tool results.\n\nno function_calls and response.text  →  answer.text = response.text, return  (go to 7)\nfunction_calls present               →  6b",
			"fontSize": 14,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.2,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "ah",
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
