			"text": "6b call_tool(call)  (nested in _ask)",
			"originalText": "6b call_tool(call)  (nested in _ask)",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 2,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.15,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "aj",
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
		{
			"id": "t-54",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1036,
			"y": 732.8,
			"width": 859.728515625,
			"height": 218.4,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"g-51"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 1708957521,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 1025639975,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795545616549,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "tools = { 'sql': sql, 'roll_odds': roll_odds, 'gold_projection': gold_projection }\n\n1. fn = tools.get(call.name)\n     unknown → [{ error: 'Unknown tool X. Use one of [...]' }]\n2. inspect.signature(fn).bind(**args)\n     wrong args → [{ error: 'Bad arguments for X: ...' }]\n3. return fn(**args)\n     sql → list[dict] (rows)       roll_odds, gold_projection → dict\n\nErrors are returned as the tool result, never raised, so Gemini reads the message and calls again with\nfixed arguments.\nTools run one after another inside the turn; several calls in one turn are all answered before the\nnext generate_content.",
			"originalText": "tools = { 'sql': sql, 'roll_odds': roll_odds, 'gold_projection': gold_projection }\n\n1. fn = tools.get(call.name)\n     unknown → [{ error: 'Unknown tool X. Use one of [...]' }]\n2. inspect.signature(fn).bind(**args)\n     wrong args → [{ error: 'Bad arguments for X: ...' }]\n3. return fn(**args)\n     sql → list[dict] (rows)       roll_odds, gold_projection → dict\n\nErrors are returned as the tool result, never raised, so Gemini reads the message and calls again with\nfixed arguments.\nTools run one after another inside the turn; several calls in one turn are all answered before the\nnext generate_content.",
			"fontSize": 14,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.2,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "ak",
