			"updated": 1795545616549,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "contents.append(response.candidates[0].content)         // the model's own function-call turn\ncontents.append(Content(role='user', parts=[\n   Part.from_function_response(name=call.name, response={ 'result': result })   // one per call\n]))\n\n→ next loop iteration calls generate_content again with the longer contents\n\nTypical chain for a gold plan:\n  gold_projection → scenarios[i].levels['8'].leftover → roll_odds(gold=[leftover]) → final text\n\nIf 8 iterations pass without text:\n  answer.text = 'No answer: the model used all 8 tool calls without finishing. Its queries are below.'",
			"originalText": "contents.append(response.candidates[0].content)         // the model's own function-call turn\ncontents.append(Content(role='user', parts=[\n   Part.from_function_response(name=call.name, response={ 'result': result })   // one per call\n]))\n\n→ next loop iteration calls generate_content again with the longer contents\n\nTypical chain for a gold plan:\n  gold_projection → scenarios[i].levels['8'].leftover → roll_odds(gold=[leftover]) → final text\n\nIf 8 iterations pass without text:\n  answer.text = 'No answer: the model used all 8 tool calls without finishing. Its queries are below.'",
