			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "docstring Gemini sees: 'Run one BigQuery SELECT over the stats views and return up to 200 rows, or\n[{\"error\": ...}] to fix and retry.'\n\nargs from Gemini:\n{ query: \"SELECT name, average_placement, top4_rate, games\n          FROM `proj.tft.current_champion_stats`\n          WHERE games >= 500 ORDER BY average_placement LIMIT 10\" }\n\n→ run_sql(client, query, answer.queries, answer.sql_runs)\n   times the call, catches BadRequest / Forbidden",
			"originalText": "docstring Gemini sees: 'Run one BigQuery SELECT over the stats views and return up to 200 rows, or\n[{\"error\": ...}] to fix and retry.'\n\nargs from Gemini:\n{ query: \"SELECT name, average_placement, top4_rate, games\n          FROM `proj.tft.current_champion_stats`\n          WHERE games >= 500 ORDER BY average_placement LIMIT 10\" }\n\n→ run_sql(client, query, answer.queries, answer.sql_runs)\n   times the call, catches BadRequest / Forbidden",
			"fontSize": 14,
			"fontFamily": 3,
