			"versionNonce": 314809481,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795545616549,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Gold, XP and Free Rolls held in the planning phase of an end round (2-2 ... 5-2), up to 3 scenarios. All\nargs optional.\n\nargs from Gemini:\n{ end_round: '4-2',\n  augments: [{ name: 'Pot of Gold', slot: '2-1' }],          // slot 2-1 | 3-2 | 4-2\n  scenarios: [{ fights: 'win' | 'mixed' | 'loss' | 'wwlwlwwl...', label: 'Fast 8',\n               gold: [{ round: '3-2', gold: -12 }],           // negative = bought units\n               levels: [{ round: '3-5', level: 6 }],          // tool buys the XP\n               carousels: [{ round: '3-4', gold: 2 }] }],\n  start_round: '2-1', start_level, start_xp, start_gold, start_streak }\n\n→ run_gold_projection(..., answer) → _gold_projection(...)",
			"originalText": "Gold, XP and Free Rolls held in the planning phase of an end round (2-2 ... 5-2), up to 3 scenarios. All\nargs optional.\n\nargs from Gemini:\n{ end_round: '4-2',\n  augments: [{ name: 'Pot of Gold', slot: '2-1' }],          // slot 2-1 | 3-2 | 4-2\n  scenarios: [{ fights: 'win' | 'mixed' | 'loss' | 'wwlwlwwl...', label: 'Fast 8',\n               gold: [{ round: '3-2', gold: -12 }],           // negative = bought units\n               levels: [{ round: '3-5', level: 6 }],          // tool buys the XP\n               carousels: [{ round: '3-4', gold: 2 }] }],\n  start_round: '2-1', start_level, start_xp, start_gold, start_streak }\n\n→ run_gold_projection(..., answer) → _gold_projection(...)",
