			"updated": 1795545616549,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "full = {\n  end_round: '4-2',\n  start: { round, level, xp, gold, streak },\n  augments: [{ slot, name, gold, free_rolls, xp_per_round, max_interest }],\n  scenarios: [{\n    label, preset | null, fights | null, ceiling: bool,\n    gold, free_rolls, free_roll_gold, total_gold, natural_xp, augment_xp, bought_xp, spent, gained, \n    leveling, level,\n    levels: { '8': { xp_missing, gold_cost, leftover }, '9': { ... } },\n    level_curve: [{ level, xp, total_xp, reached_at, xp_missing, gold_cost }],\n    series: [{ round: '3-2', kind: 'pvp' | 'carousel' | 'neutral', gold, free_roll_gold, total_gold,\n               natural_xp, augment_xp, bought_xp, free_rolls, spent, gained, leveling, level,\n               income: { interest, passive, reward, carousel, augment } }]      // one point per round\n  }]\n}\nanswer.gold_projections.append(full)       → HTTP body → GoldProjectionCharts\nresult = full with each scenario's `series` removed      → Gemini\nOverspend / bad round → { error } with the balances, so Gemini can fix the plan",
			"originalText": "full = {\n  end_round: '4-2',\n  start: { round, level, xp, gold, streak },\n  augments: [{ slot, name, gold, free_rolls, xp_per_round, max_interest }],\n  scenarios: [{\n    label, preset | null, fights | null, ceiling: bool,\n    gold, free_rolls, free_roll_gold, total_gold, natural_xp, augment_xp, bought_xp, spent, gained, \n    leveling, level,\n    levels: { '8': { xp_missing, gold_cost, leftover }, '9': { ... } },\n    level_curve: [{ level, xp, total_xp, reached_at, xp_missing, gold_cost }],\n    series: [{ round: '3-2', kind: 'pvp' | 'carousel' | 'neutral', gold, free_roll_gold, total_gold,\n               natural_xp, augment_xp, bought_xp, free_rolls, spent, gained, leveling, level,\n               income: { interest, passive, reward, carousel, augment } }]      // one point per round\n  }]\n}\nanswer.gold_projections.append(full)       → HTTP body → GoldProjectionCharts\nresult = full with each scenario's `series` removed      → Gemini\nOverspend / bad round → { error } with the balances, so Gemini can fix the plan",
