			"updated": 1795545616549,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "JSON body (snake_case) = {\n  text: string,\n  queries: string[],\n  roll_odds: [{ level, units, tier_out, results, \n  curve }],\n  gold_projections: [{ end_round, start, augments, \n  scenarios: [..., series] }]\n}\nrows, tokens and run records are NOT sent to the\nbrowser.\n\nAfter the response is written:\nconversation_log.append_turn(bucket, conversation_id,\nturn)\n→ GCS  conversations/<uuid>.json  (question, answer,\n  tokens, SQL runs, tool inputs; never result rows).\n  A GCS failure only logs.",
			"originalText": "JSON body (snake_case) = {\n  text: string,\n  queries: string[],\n  roll_odds: [{ level, units, tier_out, results, \n  curve }],\n  gold_projections: [{ end_round, start, augments, \n  scenarios: [..., series] }]\n}\nrows, tokens and run records are NOT sent to the\nbrowser.\n\nAfter the response is written:\nconversation_log.append_turn(bucket, conversation_id,\nturn)\n→ GCS  conversations/<uuid>.json  (question, answer,\n  tokens, SQL runs, tool inputs; never result rows).\n  A GCS failure only logs.",
			"fontSize": 14,
