		{
			"id": "t-157",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 56,
			"y": 3138.6,
			"width": 935.5869140625,
			"height": 302.40000000000003,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"g-154"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 2033636663,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 1801731945,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795545616549,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "input: RollOddsRun { level, units: [{ name, cost, copies, copiesOut }], tierOut: [{ cost, copies }],\n                     results: RollOddsRow[], curve: RollOddsRow[] }      RollOddsRow = { gold, rolls, allUnits,\n                      perUnit: { [name]: number } }\n\ndistinctRollOdds(runs): key = JSON.stringify([level, units, tierOut]); calls with the same key merge into one\nrun\n  → results unioned by gold and sorted, the longer curve kept.\n\nSVG line + filled area, 240 px high\n  x = gold         0 ... xMax, ticks from xTicks(reach, plotWidth),  reach = max(last curve gold, every asked \n  gold)\n  y = allUnits     0 ... 1, ticks 0 / 25 / 50 / 75 / 100 %\n  line points      [[x(0), baseline], ...curve.map(p => [x(p.gold), y(p.allUnits)])]    flat on 0 % until the \n  copies are paid for (copiesCost = curve[0].gold)\n  dots             one per results row (the gold amounts that were asked) once allUnits >= 1 %\n  hover, touch, arrow keys → active = round((gold - spend) / 2) = index into curve → tooltip lists \n  perUnit[unit.name] for every unit\n  aria-label       describeRollOdds(run) + 'Chance of hitting every unit: 73 % at 80 gold, ...'",
			"originalText": "input: RollOddsRun { level, units: [{ name, cost, copies, copiesOut }], tierOut: [{ cost, copies }],\n                     results: RollOddsRow[], curve: RollOddsRow[] }      RollOddsRow = { gold, rolls, allUnits,\n                      perUnit: { [name]: number } }\n\ndistinctRollOdds(runs): key = JSON.stringify([level, units, tierOut]); calls with the same key merge into one\nrun\n  → results unioned by gold and sorted, the longer curve kept.\n\nSVG line + filled area, 240 px high\n  x = gold         0 ... xMax, ticks from xTicks(reach, plotWidth),  reach = max(last curve gold, every asked \n  gold)\n  y = allUnits     0 ... 1, ticks 0 / 25 / 50 / 75 / 100 %\n  line points      [[x(0), baseline], ...curve.map(p => [x(p.gold), y(p.allUnits)])]    flat on 0 % until the \n  copies are paid for (copiesCost = curve[0].gold)\n  dots             one per results row (the gold amounts that were asked) once allUnits >= 1 %\n  hover, touch, arrow keys → active = round((gold - spend) / 2) = index into curve → tooltip lists \n  perUnit[unit.name] for every unit\n  aria-label       describeRollOdds(run) + 'Chance of hitting every unit: 73 % at 80 gold, ...'",
			"fontSize": 14,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.2,
			"autoResize": true,
