		{
			"id": "t-161",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1116,
			"y": 3138.6,
			"width": 935.5869140625,
			"height": 369.6,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"g-158"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 244051093,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 529464007,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795545616549,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "input: GoldProjectionRun { endRound, start, augments[], scenarios: GoldProjectionScenario[] }\ndistinctGoldProjections() drops repeated identical calls\nScenario colours = SCENARIO_STYLES[position] → series-1...3 tokens (colour-blind-checked); Free Rolls use the\nlighter 40 % step\n\n1. Gold bars, one chart per scenario, shared y scale (goldMax = max(totalGold + spent + leveling)):\ngoldBars(series)\n   x = point.round   (under-label 'Car' for kind 'carousel', 'Neu' for 'neutral')\n   solid bar = point.gold   ·   lighter cap on top = point.freeRollGold   ·   bold label = point.totalGold\n   dashed outline above = point.spent + point.leveling, label -N  (gold the round already spent)\n   hover details: income (interest, passive, reward, carousel, augment), gained, spent on units, spent on XP \n   (+bought XP)\n\n2. XP chart(s): xpBars(series, levelCurve): stacked per round naturalXp (grey) / augmentXp (primary) / boughtXp\n(scenario colour)\n   horizontal threshold lines = levelCurve[].totalXp (Lv 8 and 9 emphasised); mark under each bar = 'Lv ' + \n   point.level\n   one chart if sameXp(scenarios), else one per scenario\n\n3. Text for reading and screen readers: RoundsTable (round, held, movesText = gained / units / XP, level),\n   levels 8 and 9 { xpMissing, goldCost, leftover → leftoverText 'short N' when negative },\n   curveGroups(): one level_curve table per distinct curve",
			"originalText": "input: GoldProjectionRun { endRound, start, augments[], scenarios: GoldProjectionScenario[] }\ndistinctGoldProjections() drops repeated identical calls\nScenario colours = SCENARIO_STYLES[position] → series-1...3 tokens (colour-blind-checked); Free Rolls use the\nlighter 40 % step\n\n1. Gold bars, one chart per scenario, shared y scale (goldMax = max(totalGold + spent + leveling)):\ngoldBars(series)\n   x = point.round   (under-label 'Car' for kind 'carousel', 'Neu' for 'neutral')\n   solid bar = point.gold   ·   lighter cap on top = point.freeRollGold   ·   bold label = point.totalGold\n   dashed outline above = point.spent + point.leveling, label -N  (gold the round already spent)\n   hover details: income (interest, passive, reward, carousel, augment), gained, spent on units, spent on XP \n   (+bought XP)\n\n2. XP chart(s): xpBars(series, levelCurve): stacked per round naturalXp (grey) / augmentXp (primary) / boughtXp\n(scenario colour)\n   horizontal threshold lines = levelCurve[].totalXp (Lv 8 and 9 emphasised); mark under each bar = 'Lv ' + \n   point.level\n   one chart if sameXp(scenarios), else one per scenario\n\n3. Text for reading and screen readers: RoundsTable (round, held, movesText = gained / units / XP, level),\n   levels 8 and 9 { xpMissing, goldCost, leftover → leftoverText 'short N' when negative },\n   curveGroups(): one level_curve table per distinct curve",
